        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nirih</strong> is a fast-paced vertical platformer that combines lightning-quick, precise movement with intense reactions in free fall. With breathtaking speed, you plunge through the levels, mastering challenging obstacles, tight passages, and deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt your targets through 30 challenging levels in three unique worlds, optimize your times, and fight your way to the top of the global leaderboard. Only the fastest and most skilled will make it all the way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for the challenge?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST-PACED GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the lingering energy of the bosses to increase your speed and race through the levels. But stay alert, treacherous obstacles and deadly traps lurk everywhere as you follow their trail. Only those who perfectly master focus and speed will survive the fall into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face thrilling boss fights, hunt your prey, and avoid their deadly attacks and devious traps. Only with perfect timing and fast reflexes will you defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/4d96edf00c7746d2a4fbe7a3953fbb7e.poster.avif?t=1777274737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/4d96edf00c7746d2a4fbe7a3953fbb7e.webm?t=1777274737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THREATENING WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the levels and the unique traits of each world to use them to your advantage and continuously improve your high score. Break your personal best times to unlock new levels and cosmetic items – and eventually conquer the top of the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/1e9c7383e3455cb64da43d44e8df098b.poster.avif?t=1777274737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/1e9c7383e3455cb64da43d44e8df098b.webm?t=1777274737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SET NEW RECORDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your personal best times in each level, unlock new levels, and discover additional worlds and their challenges. Earn cosmetic items to customize your hunter and show off your personal style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/19e3da28818897a7db03464f3d8f0e7f.poster.avif?t=1777274737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/19e3da28818897a7db03464f3d8f0e7f.webm?t=1777274737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nirih</strong> is a fast-paced vertical platformer that combines lightning-quick, precise movement with intense reactions in free fall. With breathtaking speed, you plunge through the levels, mastering challenging obstacles, tight passages, and deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt your targets through 30 challenging levels in three unique worlds, optimize your times, and fight your way to the top of the global leaderboard. Only the fastest and most skilled will make it all the way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for the challenge?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST-PACED GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the lingering energy of the bosses to increase your speed and race through the levels. But stay alert, treacherous obstacles and deadly traps lurk everywhere as you follow their trail. Only those who perfectly master focus and speed will survive the fall into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face thrilling boss fights, hunt your prey, and avoid their deadly attacks and devious traps. Only with perfect timing and fast reflexes will you defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/4d96edf00c7746d2a4fbe7a3953fbb7e.poster.avif?t=1777274737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/4d96edf00c7746d2a4fbe7a3953fbb7e.webm?t=1777274737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THREATENING WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the levels and the unique traits of each world to use them to your advantage and continuously improve your high score. Break your personal best times to unlock new levels and cosmetic items – and eventually conquer the top of the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/1e9c7383e3455cb64da43d44e8df098b.poster.avif?t=1777274737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/1e9c7383e3455cb64da43d44e8df098b.webm?t=1777274737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SET NEW RECORDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your personal best times in each level, unlock new levels, and discover additional worlds and their challenges. Earn cosmetic items to customize your hunter and show off your personal style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/19e3da28818897a7db03464f3d8f0e7f.poster.avif?t=1777274737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/19e3da28818897a7db03464f3d8f0e7f.webm?t=1777274737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
